  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Retain project filenames after opening and saving, add Save As, and show the filename in the title bar.\n- Rename, reorder, copy, and paste operations. Use the saved operation order for toolpath playback.\n- Add browser collapse controls, viewport visibility controls, and editor Close buttons.\n- Guard empty GPU buffer slices, show the saved operation type, and confirm type changes.\n\n## Compatibility\n\nThe project format moves to v50. Older Camcraft builds cannot open projects saved by this version.\n\n## Verification\n\n- The `camcraft-ui` test suite passed before the latest sync with `main`; the synced branch is pending validation.\n- The recovered four-hole project opened, edited, and regenerated successfully in the desktop app.\n\nThe Setup toolbar entry, Setups page in a new document, and browser grouping by setup remain open in #45. Those UI changes were reverted at the user's request.\n\nChangelog: Improve project file handling, operation editing and ordering, browser controls, and rendering stability.\n\nRefs #45\n",
